gnome-shell-extension-deepmon (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Popup redesign: whale logo in the header, 320 px minimum width,
    period values without the glued day suffix, single caption line for
    other currencies and top-ups, separate "данных: N из 30" line.
  * Optional platform session token: daily costs from the private
    usage endpoint now fill past days and take precedence over the
    locally measured balance deltas.
  * deepmon-key: --platform for the session token, status shows both
    secrets, stty gets the terminal device explicitly (echo off works).

